diff --git a/api-reference/owner-api-v1/overview.mdx b/api-reference/owner-api-v1/overview.mdx
index 2653413..886c135 100644
--- a/api-reference/owner-api-v1/overview.mdx
+++ b/api-reference/owner-api-v1/overview.mdx
@@ -1,6 +1,6 @@
 ---
 title: Owner API
-description: Retrieve per-wallet positions, balances, and claimable rewards
+description: Retrieve cached per-wallet positions and balances
 ---
 
 The Owner API provides per-wallet views of Raydium positions and balances. It fetches cached data for positions, locked liquidity, created pools, and IDO participation, making it ideal for wallet UIs and portfolio dashboards.
@@ -14,13 +14,19 @@ The Owner API provides per-wallet views of Raydium positions and balances. It fe
 
 ## Overview
 
-The API exposes five main endpoints organized by resource type:
+The API exposes four main endpoints organized by resource type:
 
 - **`/position/stake/{owner}`** — Stake positions (standard AMM / CPMM LP)
 - **`/position/clmm-lock/{owner}`** — Locked CLMM positions
 - **`/create-pool/{owner}`** — Pools created by this wallet
 - **`/main/ido/{owner}`** — IDO participation data
 
+## Farm rewards
+
+The [stake positions endpoint](/api-reference/owner-api-v1-endpoints/position/get-stake-positions-for-a-wallet) returns cached stake data. It does not return pending reward amounts or reward mints.
+
+Use `raydium.farm.fetchFarmBalances()` to calculate pending rewards with Solana RPC access. See the [wallet integration example](/integration-guides/wallet-integration#farm-stake) for amount units and calculation limits.
+
 ## Data freshness
 
 This service caches position data and updates it periodically. Very recent position changes (within seconds) may not appear immediately in responses.
